Vates Kube OS — third-party notices
====================================

This image is assembled from pinned upstream sources. The list of record is
build/pins.conf in the source repository: one line per component, naming its
version, its source tarball, its sha256 and its upstream URL. Each component's
license text is kept under /usr/share/licenses/ when upstream ships one.

The Xen guest agent and the C libraries it links:

  libxenstore, libxentoolcore, libxentoollog        LGPL-2.1-or-later
      from Xen 4.21.2 — https://xenproject.org/
      license text: /usr/share/licenses/libxenstore/

  xen-guest-agent                                   AGPL-3.0-only
      from https://gitlab.com/xen-project/xen-guest-agent
      license text: /usr/share/licenses/xen-guest-agent/

The libraries are linked dynamically — the .so files are separate files under
/usr/lib — so a recipient can replace them; no relinking is required.

The full sources and the recipes that build the image are in the Vates Kube OS
repository (build/recipes/).
